=¡yË@ÌÌÌÌÌÍ¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¦ì´ë‹¤¢zh¦ä¼Šè¾¾¦quests§1005118Œ¥patch¢id§1005118¢en¨Papalymo¢ja¬ãƒ‘ãƒ‘ãƒªãƒ¢¢de¨Papalymo¢fr¨Papalymo¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘ÙWhile there are others who possess the Echo, none are near as strong as you with the power. Hence our <i>extremely</i> high expectations of you!¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@G®záH¡yË@¸Që…¸¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¬íŒŒíŒŒë¦¬ëª¨¢zh¬å¸•å¸•åŠ›èŽ«¦quests§1005119Œ¥patch¢id§1005119¢en¨Thancred¢ja²ã‚µãƒ³ã‚¯ãƒ¬ãƒƒãƒ‰¢de¨Thancred¢fr¨Thancred¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù›Summoning a primal is no small feat. It requires a tremendous concentration of aether, which is why the beast tribes go to such lengths to obtain crystals.Ù¥Once they manifest in physical form, their unquenchable thirst for aether only grows stronger. They would drink the land dry with nary a thought to the consequences.ÙConsidering their fearsome strength, it could be well within their ability to do so. It is for this reason we must do our utmost to oppose them.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@(õÂ\)¡yË@␀␀␀␀␀␀¡zË?„záG®{¢ko¬ì‚°í¬ë ˆë“œ¢zh¬æ¡‘å…‹ç‘žå¾·¦quests‘…¢idÎ␀þ¤name„¢en½A Wild Rose by Any Other Name¢jaÙ$ã‚­ãƒ£ãƒ³ãƒ—ãƒ»ãƒ‰ãƒ©ã‚¤ãƒœãƒ¼ãƒ³ã¸¢de«Wilde Rosen¢frÙ!L'alliance pour la SeptiÃ¨me Aube¤icon´/i/071000/071201.png§rewards‘‚¢idÍÅ¦amount¦banner´/i/100000/100074.png§1005120Œ¥patch¢id§1005120¢en¨Y'shtola¢ja²ãƒ¤ãƒ»ã‚·ãƒ¥ãƒˆãƒ©¢de¨Y'shtola¢fr¨Y'shtola¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙËOur organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing.ÙbThe second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve.ÙThe terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@áG®zá¡yË@õÂ\(ö¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¬ì•¼ìŠˆí†¨ë¼¢zh®é›…Â·ä¿®ç‰¹æ‹‰¦quests§1005121Œ¥patch¢id§1005121¢en¨Urianger¢ja²ã‚¦ãƒªã‚¨ãƒ³ã‚¸ã‚§¢de¨Urianger¢fr¨Urianger¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù\<i>Seven waning moons see seven suns rise,<br>Divine order roils, fallen corpses writhe.</i>Ù›Thus the Divine Chronicles seek to warn us once more. The meaning of these words now shines clear: they evoke the dire circumstance of this imperiled age. ÙÕThe realm doth shudder and twist, and the dawn lieth cowering 'neath the stifling blanket of night. And we abide. We await the coming of the unborn era's seedâ”€the Light which shall pierce the glowering Darkness.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@záG®{¡yË@£×
=p¤¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¬ìœ„ë¦¬ì•™ì œ¢zh¬äºŽé‡Œæ˜‚çƒ­¦quests§1005122Œ¥patch¢id§1005122¢en¨Minfilia¢ja²ãƒŸãƒ³ãƒ•ã‚£ãƒªã‚¢¢de¨Minfilia¢fr¨Minfilia¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’Ù¥With the power you possess, there will be those who wish you ill, and you must needs be on the lookout for them. Yet however vigilant you are, you are but one woman.Ù¢In the midst of a Grand Company, however, you will be one woman amongst manyâ”€a friend amongst friends. Your achievements will be shared, and so will the danger.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@£×
=p¤¡yË@\(õÂ¡zË?„záG®{¢ko¬ë¯¼í•„ë¦¬ì•„¢zh¬æ•è²åˆ©äºš¦quests‘„¢idÎ␀ÿ¤name„¢en´A Hero in the Making¢ja¬è‹±é›„ã®åµ¢de·Den Helden zum Gedenken¢fr´L'Ã©toffe des hÃ©ros¤icon´/i/071000/071201.png¦banner´/i/100000/100077.png§1005123Œ¥patch¢id§1005123¢en£Yda¢ja¦ã‚¤ãƒ€¢de£Yda¢fr£Yda¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘ÙrSpeeches? Oh, yes, I <i>love</i> them. There's nothing like a good exposition when you're having trouble sleeping!¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@¸Që…¡yË@®záG®¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¦ì´ë‹¤¢zh¦ä¼Šè¾¾¦quests§1005124Œ¥patch¢id§1005124¢en¨Papalymo¢ja¬ãƒ‘ãƒ‘ãƒªãƒ¢¢de¨Papalymo¢fr¨Papalymo¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙmFive years ago, the three Grand Companies joined as one and fought the Garlean Empire at the Carteneau Flats.Ù]And now, for the first time, the people will gather to remember those who fell in the battle.ÙwThat being said, no one has any clear memory of what transpired that fateful dayâ”€not even the leaders of each nation.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@záG®¡yË@£×
=p¤¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¬íŒŒíŒŒë¦¬ëª¨¢zh¬å¸•å¸•åŠ›èŽ«¦quests§1005125Œ¥patch¢id§1005125¢en¨Thancred¢ja²ã‚µãƒ³ã‚¯ãƒ¬ãƒƒãƒ‰¢de¨Thancred¢fr¨Thancred¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘Ù{You've put us all to shame with your recent performance in the field. If I'm to keep up, I daresay I'll need bigger knives!¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@®záG®¡yË@(õÂ\)¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¬ì‚°í¬ë ˆë“œ¢zh¬æ¡‘å…‹ç‘žå¾·¦quests§1005126Œ¥patch¢id§1005126¢en¨Y'shtola¢ja²ãƒ¤ãƒ»ã‚·ãƒ¥ãƒˆãƒ©¢de¨Y'shtola¢fr¨Y'shtola¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙeI have heard word of your deeds. I am sparing in my praise, so know that you have truly impressed me.Ù’Be that as it may, it is fortunate that Thancred arrived when he did. Had he been but a moment later, I shudder to think what may have transpired.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@ffffff¡yË@¸Që…¸¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¬ì•¼ìŠˆí†¨ë¼¢zh®é›…Â·ä¿®ç‰¹æ‹‰¦quests§1005127Œ¥patch¢id§1005127¢en¨Urianger¢ja²ã‚¦ãƒªã‚¨ãƒ³ã‚¸ã‚§¢de¨Urianger¢fr¨Urianger¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù^The destruction that visited this land cannot be attributed to the forces of the Empire alone.ÙvWyrm of midnight, of breath infernal... For some, a legend made flesh; for others, an insidious symbol of memory lost.Ù…We grasp but a piece of this puzzle. Much and more must we question and contemplate ere the fallen moon revealeth its myriad secrets.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@…¸Që…¡yË@×
