=p¤¡yË@(õÂ\)¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¦ì˜¬ë¦¬¢zh¦å¥¥èŽ‰¦quests§1007357Œ¥patch¢id§1007357¢en¨Arenvald¢jaµã‚¢ãƒ¬ãƒ³ãƒ´ã‚¡ãƒ«ãƒ‰¢de¨Arenvald¢fr¨Arenvald¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’Ù„They say that those of us who have seen the dream are chosen, that we have within us the seed of greatness. That we could be heroes.Ù×Even me, an Ala Mhigan half-breed, cast out when his mother could no longer stand the sight of him. A half-breed who once took to banditry just to eat. Aye, I'm sure I'm just <i>brimming</i> with heroic potential...¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@™™™™™š¡yË@=p£×
