=p¤¡yË@G®záH¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¬ì•„ë Œë°œë“œ¢zh²é˜¿é›·æ©ç“¦å°”å¾·¦quests§1007365Œ¥patch¢id§1007365¢enªUna Tayuun¢jaµã‚¦ãƒŠãƒ»ã‚¿ãƒ¦ãƒ¼ãƒ³¢deªUna Tayuun¢frªUna Tayuun¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’Ù–<crunch> <crunch> ...<br><crunch> <crunch> ...Oh, hello again, lass! Meet Percevainsâ”€we was thick as thieves in the old days. Least, I think we was.Ù±...Or it might've been that he was a right creepy bastard, an' I did me best t' avoid him. Still, we was both members o' the old order, so either way we're in this together, eh?¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@\(õÂ¡yË@Që…¸R¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko­ìš°ë‚˜ íƒ€ìœ¤¢zh±ä¹Œçº³Â·å¡”å°¤æ©¦quests§1007368Œ¥patch¢id§1007368¢en¦Brendt¢ja¯ãƒ–ãƒ¬ãƒ¢ãƒ³ãƒ‰¢de¦Brendt¢fr¦Brendt¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘ÙCEverythin' looks to be in order. Rightâ”€on to the next customer...¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@záG®{¡yË@\(õÂ¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¬ë¸Œë ˆëª½ë“œ¢zh¬å¸ƒèŽ±è’™å¾·¦quests§1007370Œ¥patch¢id§1007370¢en¥Aulie¢ja¦ã‚ªãƒª¢de¥Aulie¢fr¥Aulie¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’Ù¦I'm not sure I grasp the purpose of these remembrance ceremonies. Whether you remember or rewrite the past, what does it matter? It isn't as though you can repeat it.ÙÄOur present-day enemies ought to serve as sufficient motivation, don't you think? The only lesson I believe we should take from the Calamity is that far greater threats can and <i>will</i> appear.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@¸Që…¸¡yË@G®záH¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¦ì˜¬ë¦¬¢zh¦å¥¥èŽ‰¦quests§1007371Œ¥patch¢id§1007371¢en¨Arenvald¢jaµã‚¢ãƒ¬ãƒ³ãƒ´ã‚¡ãƒ«ãƒ‰¢de¨Arenvald¢fr¨Arenvald¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘Ù”I hear you pledged yourself to a Grand Company. Me? I don't think I could do it. I'd never feel like one of them, no matter what the recruiters say.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@£×
=p¤¡yË@G®záH¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko¬ì•„ë Œë°œë“œ¢zh²é˜¿é›·æ©ç“¦å°”å¾·¦quests§1007372Œ¥patch¢id§1007372¢enªUna Tayuun¢jaµã‚¦ãƒŠãƒ»ã‚¿ãƒ¦ãƒ¼ãƒ³¢deªUna Tayuun¢frªUna Tayuun¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘ÙëI've been chattin' with Percevains, an' we both swear there was another member of our crew. We still ain't figured out a way t' prove who we was, but just ye wait and see. It won't be long before everybody sees us for the heroes we is!¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@záG®{¡yË@\(õÂ\¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko­ìš°ë‚˜ íƒ€ìœ¤¢zh±ä¹Œçº³Â·å¡”å°¤æ©¦quests§1007375Œ¥patch¢id§1007375¢en¨Liavinne¢ja¯ãƒªã‚¢ãƒ´ã‚£ãƒŒ¢de¨Liavinne¢fr¨Liavinne¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙlHave we met somewhere before? You must be quite the accomplished adventurer to be welcomed into these halls.ÙmMe? No one's ever expected much of me. And so far, I've done a fine job of living down to their expectations.¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@p£×
=q¡yË@záG®¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko©ë¦¬ì•„ë¹ˆ¢zh¬èŽ‰äºšç»´å¨œ¦quests§1007376Œ¥patch¢id§1007376¢en®Tajih Mewrilah¢ja¸ã‚¿ã‚¸ãƒ»ãƒŸãƒ¥ãƒªãƒ©ãƒ¼¢de®Tajih Mewrilah¢fr®Tajih Mewrilah¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@®záG®¡yË@áG®zá¡zË¿¤záG®{¢ko°íƒ€ì§€ ë®¤ë¦´ë¼¢zh±å¡”å‰Â·ç¼ªé‡Œæ‹‰¦quests§1007377Œ¥patch¢id§1007377¢en§Brennan¢ja¯ãƒ–ãƒ¬ãƒ¢ãƒ³ãƒ‡¢de§Brennan¢fr§Brennan¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÚHey, ain't you the lass that rode that boat into Limsa Lominsa with me? It is you, ain't it! Hah! Glad to see you've found a good home. What am I doin' here? Well, I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.ÙÐI ain't seen either one of 'em since the Calamityâ”€didn't even know if they were still alive. But after runnin' into folk who swore they knew me time an' again, I reckoned they had to be out there somewhere.Ù¬I've been travelin' an' peddlin' in the hopes I'd find me brothers ever since. If ye see a fella what looks like me, let him know that Brennan's lookin' for him, would you?¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@õÂ\(ö¡yË@Â\(õÃ¡zË¿ž¸Që…¸¢ko¬ë¸Œë ˆëª½ë°¢zh¬å¸ƒèŽ±è’™è¿ª¦quests§1007380‹¥patch¢id§1007380¢en£Yda¢ja¦ã‚¤ãƒ€¢de£Yda¢fr£Yda¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘Ù:We're going to be traveling companions! Isn't it exciting?¢ko¦ì´ë‹¤¢zh¦ä¼Šè¾¾¦quests§1007381‹¥patch¢id§1007381¢en¨Papalymo¢ja¬ãƒ‘ãƒ‘ãƒªãƒ¢¢de¨Papalymo¢fr¨Papalymo¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙYAt the best of times, the sylphs are as our own younglingsâ”€naive and given to mischief.Ù¡In the course of your dealings with them, it may be all you can do not to scream in frustration. But rest assured Yda and I will be there to share in the burden.¢ko¬íŒŒíŒŒë¦¬ëª¨¢zh¬å¸•å¸•åŠ›èŽ«¦quests§1007382Œ¥patch¢id§1007382¢en¨Urianger¢ja²ã‚¦ãƒªã‚¨ãƒ³ã‚¸ã‚§¢de¨Urianger¢fr¨Urianger¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙfRamuh, beloved primal of the sylphs. Rooted is he in the laws of eld, the stern arbiter of the forest.Ù’Legend hath it this thunderous entity appeareth in the guise of an elderly sage. Thus doth history oft speaketh of the â€œold man of the woods.â€¨position…¦zoneidÍd£mapP¡xË@=p£×
