ur¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙmLook at that, fireworks. Just had 'em for the Moonfire Faire, didn't we? This lot's for the Calamity, though.ÙeLook at 'em colors! Musta been a deal of work for the pyromancers. That's what I call a tribute, aye.¢koºê¸¸ê°€ë¥¼ ì‚´í”¼ëŠ” ìƒì¸¢zhµè§‚å¯Ÿè·¯å†µçš„å•†äºº¦quests§1009681‹¥patch¢id§1009681¢en¯breaking bowyer¢jaµä¼‘æ†©ä¸­ã®å¼“è·äºº¢de´erschÃ¶pft[a] Bogner¢fr¶facteur d'arc fatiguÃ©¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙFunny thing, grief. You're a bow drawn, don't even know the strain till somethin' releases itâ”€somethin' like these fireworks.ÙžBawled like a baby the first night the Adventurers' Guild put on the display, I did. They say there's one in every city. A footloose lass could see 'em all...¢koºíœ´ì‹ ì¤‘ì¸ í™œì œìž‘ì‚¬¢zhµä¼‘æ¯ä¸­çš„å¼“å·¥åŒ ¦quests§1009682‹¥patch¢id§1009682¢en²reminiscing ranger¢ja»è¿½æƒ³ã«ãµã‘ã‚‹å†’é™ºè€…¢deÙ*in Erinnerungen schwelgend[a] Abenteurerin¢fr¸aventuriÃ¨re nostalgique¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙtMore fireworks at night, have you marked them? They say it's for the dead, that it's in remembrance of the Calamity.ÙªWhat I want is to forget, not remember. Am I to ooh and aah over fire in the sky? A rain of fire there was, and my brother, he...no, they are not for me, these fireworks.¢koºìƒê°ì— ìž ê¸´ ëª¨í—˜ê°€¢zh¸é™·å…¥å›žå¿†çš„å†’é™©è€…¦quests§1009683‹¥patch¢id§1009683¢enµsky-gazing sweetheart¢ja²ç©ºã‚’è¦‹ã‚‹å©¦äºº¢deÙ$in den Himmel blickend[a] SchÃ¶nheit¢fr·femme regardant le ciel¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙÔOh no, these are not for the Moonfire Faire. These fireworks are in remembrance of the Calamityâ”€and rebirth of the realm. It's the Adventurers' Guild that paints the night sky thus. Have you heard them singing?ÙjHave light, will travel, if your nights be darkï½žâ™ª<br>An adventure's naught if not done on a lark...â™ª»A hardy lot, and merry too!¢ko·í•˜ëŠ˜ì„ ë³´ëŠ” ë¶€ì¸¢zhµä»°æœ›å¤©ç©ºçš„å¦‡äºº¦quests§1009684‹¥patch¢id§1009684¢en°of