da¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙÀWe've barely ushered Heavensward out the door, and already we need to decide on a direction for the next expansion. The deadline for that opening movie storyboard is right around the corner...ÙûWhere should we base this new adventure? Under the sea? Under the ground? On the moon, mayhap...? Even if we do have a fair amount of time until release, we have to plan out announcements, and coming up with a brand-new scenario is never an easy task.Ù–And then there'll have to be new jobs, of course. Samurai? Or how about red mage? Hmmm... Oh! You'll keep these idle musings to yourself, won't you!? ¢ko³ìš”ì‹œë‹¤ ë‚˜ì˜¤í‚¤¢zh¬å‰ç”°ç›´æ ‘¦quests‘…¢idÎ␀V¤name„¢en¬A World Away¢ja»æ–°ç”Ÿç¥­ã¨éŽ®é­‚ã®å¤œç©º¢de·So nah und doch so fern¢fr²Si loin, si proche¤icon´/i/080000/080113.png§rewards’‚¢idÍ/!¦amount‚¢idÍ/¦amount¦banner´/i/100000/100462.png§1015692‹¥patch¢id§1015692¢en¯Hideyuki Kasuga¢ja¸ã‚«ã‚¹ã‚¬ãƒ»ãƒ’ãƒ‡ãƒ¦ã‚­¢de¯Hideyuki Kasuga¢fr¯Hideyuki Kasuga¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙnHi there! I'm Hideyuki Kasuga, the lead programmer. I'm in charge of all of FFXIV's engineering-related tasks.Ù³There is so much I would like to tell you about the technical side of things...but I'm afraid my explanations tend to get a bit long-winded. Probably best if we skip that for now.Ù•Tech matters aside, I'm glad to see you having fun with the game. There's a lot more excitement to come, so keep an eye out for future announcements!¢ko¶ì¹´ìŠ¤ê°€ ížˆë°ìœ í‚¤¢zh¬æ˜¥æ—¥ç§€ä¹‹¦quests§1015693‹¥patch¢id§1015693¢en¯Masayoshi Soken¢ja¸ã‚½ã‚±ãƒ³ãƒ»ãƒžã‚µãƒ¨ã‚·¢de¯Masayoshi Soken¢fr¯Masayoshi Soken¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù.I'm Masayoshi Soken, sound director for FFXIV.ÙuDay an' night I'm here, workin' on ways to enhance our players' gamin' experience...but who wants to talk about that?ÙuSomehow, someday, I wanna see this room filled with a crowd of Warriors of Light wearin' Arachne culottes of healin'!¢ko³ì†Œì¼„ ë§ˆì‚¬ìš”ì‹œ¢zh¬ç¥–åšæ­£åº†¦quests§1015695‹¥patch¢id§1015695¢en¯Toshio Murouchi¢ja¸ãƒ ãƒ­ã‚¦ãƒãƒ»ãƒˆã‚·ã‚ª¢de¯Toshio Murouchi¢fr¯Toshio Murouchi¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù®Greetings, I'm Toshio Murouchi from the Community Team. When people ask, that's how I explain my position, but I also do a lot of work for the operations and marketing teams.ÙáI can hardly believe we're already celebrating two years for A Realm Reborn! I fly all over the world for FFXIV-related events, and I recently calculated the distance I've traveled over the course of the last twelve months...Ú...A total of 154,750 kilometers! Oh, that is just insane... Not that it will stop me from flitting across the globe for the next twelve months to share in the hopes and dreams of our fans! ...Speaking of which, it's about time I started planning for the next Fan Festival!¢ko¶ë¬´ë¡œìš°ì¹˜ í† ì‹œì˜¤¢zh¬å®¤å†…ä¿Šå¤«¦quests§1015696‹¥patch¢id§1015696¢en¬Takeo Suzuki¢jaµã‚¹ã‚ºã‚­ãƒ»ã‚¿ã‚±ã‚ª¢de¬Takeo Suzuki¢fr¬Takeo Suzuki¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù¶Hello! I'm Takeo Suzuki, the lead designer. My position has me overseeing the graphics for the entire game, which includes all the characters, animations, backgrounds, and cutscenes.Ù°Thank you for coming to visit us here on the Eighteenth Floor! We love to hear from our playersâ”€your interest and support are always a source of enthusiasm and encouragement.ÙŽWe want to meet all your expectations, and will keep coming up with interesting new equipment and dungeons! Let's enjoy this journey together!¢ko³ìŠ¤ì¦ˆí‚¤ íƒ€ì¼€ì˜¤¢zh¬é“ƒæœ¨å¥å¤«¦quests§1015697‹¥patch¢id§1015697¢en°Hiroshi Minagawa¢ja¸ãƒŸãƒŠã‚¬ãƒ¯ãƒ»ãƒ’ãƒ­ã‚·¢de°Hiroshi Minagawa¢fr°Hiroshi Minagawa¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙïGreetings, I'm Hiroshi Minagawa, the lead UI and web artist. I'm usually in charge of how the interface looks and feels, but this time around I was also fortunate enough to be involved with light and shadow adjustments for background maps.Ù¹As he did for A Realm Reborn, Yoshitaka Amano created both the logo silhouette and concept art for Heavensward. ...And he also threw in a bonus piece above and beyond what we asked for.ÙêThis bonus art can be seen in the collector's editionâ”€the shiny, silver illustration. It's a cool piece, and I highly recommend you check it out. Thanks for stopping by! I hope you continue to enjoy the game for a long time to come!¢ko¶ë¯¸ë‚˜ê°€ì™€ ížˆë¡œì‹œ¢zh¬çš†å·è£•å²¦quests§1015698‹¥patch¢id§1015698¢en¨Koji Fox¢ja»ã‚³ãƒ¼ã‚¸ãƒ»ãƒ•ã‚©ãƒƒã‚¯ã‚¹¢de¨Koji Fox¢fr¨Koji Fox¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÚXWaitâ”€you can see me? This is...most interesting. Why? Because I'm not here. There is no possible way I could be here...at least according to the rules which govern Hydaelyn. And it was I who helped create those rulesâ”€at least I think I did... But if I'm here, then where is the â€œrealâ€ me? Any number of theories are possible, I suppose.Ú3It could be that the Calamity has somehow split my being in twoâ”€half of the aether gathering here, the other half...elsewhere. The western continent, perhaps? The moon? It could be that what you see before you is but a clone, grown in some laboratorium by the selfsame scholars who created those terrible simulacra for Emperor Xande. And, it could be that this world is being generated by some ancient Allagan machine still humming away thousands of years after the fall of their civilizationâ”€a virtual representation of the realm within which I truly reside.ÚOr, it could simply be that I am a song passed down by Eorzea's bards so often that I have become manifest in a method similar to how primals are summoned by the beast tribes. Or, it could be that this is all a dream...but that would be stupid. I'll have to give this further thought.¢ko­ì½”ì§€ í­ìŠ¤¢zh¬ä»¤ç‹å­¤å¯‚¦quests§1015699‹¥patch¢id§1015699¢en°Kazutoyo Maehiro¢ja»ãƒžã‚¨ãƒ’ãƒ­ãƒ»ã‚«ã‚ºãƒˆãƒ¨¢de°Kazutoyo Maehiro¢fr°Kazutoyo Maehiro¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙØRight. I've finished writing this quest, sent the request for that animation, and implemented that other thing...now it's time to speak with Soken about the music, and ask Hiroshi when he wants to do Alexandâ”€ Whoa!Ùy[UNHANDLED 0x2C], it's you! I'm Maehiro, the main scenario writer. I'd been hoping to meet you since before the Calamity!Ù«On this, the second anniversary of A Realm Reborn, I am thrilled to find you here, enjoying our game. May you continue to enjoy the story of Eorzea for many moons to come!¢ko¹ë§ˆì—ížˆë¡œ ì¹´ì¦ˆí† ìš”¢zh¬å‰å¹¿å’Œä¸°¦quests§1015700‹¥patch¢id§1015700¢en­Hiroshi Takai¢jaµã‚¿ã‚«ã‚¤ãƒ»ãƒ’ãƒ­ã‚·¢de­Hiroshi Takai¢fr­Hiroshi Takai¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù7Man, I'm never gonna get that Atma of the Scales... Hm?ÙyYou're an adventurer, aren't you? I can tell. I'm Hiroshi Takai, assistant director on FFXIV. It's wonderful to meet you!Ù¬Without you and your fellow players, we wouldn't be here, celebrating our two-year anniversary. We are deeply grateful for your support! Thank you, and see you in the game!¢ko³íƒ€ì¹´ì´ ížˆë¡œì‹œ¢zh©é«˜äº•æµ©¦quests§1015701‹¥patch¢id§1015701¢en®Nobuaki Komoto¢ja»ã‚³ã‚¦ãƒ¢ãƒˆãƒ»ãƒŽãƒ–ã‚¢ã‚­¢de®Nobuaki Komoto¢fr¯Nobuaki KÃ´moto¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙÆGreetings! I'm Nobuaki Komoto, the lead planner. Amongst a multitude of other tasks, it's my job to coordinate between the planners and the programmers, and help balance development with operations.Ù[Day in and day out, the dev team is working hard to bring you a steady stream of enjoyment.ÙŸWe're listening to all your requests, criticisms, and encouragement, and are looking forward to shaping an ever bigger and brighter Eorzea right alongside you!¢ko¹ì½”ìš°ëª¨í†  ë…¸ë¶€ì•„í‚¤¢zh¬æ²³æœ¬ä¿¡æ˜­¦quests§1015702‹¥patch¢id§1015702¢en®Koji Shirasugi¢ja¸ã‚·ãƒ©ã‚¹ã‚®ãƒ»ã‚³ã‚¦ã‚¸¢de®Koji Shirasugi¢fr¯KÃ´ji Shirasugi¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù“A pleasure to meet youâ”€I'm Koji Shirasugi from the Online Business Management Division. You may also have seen me embarrassing myself as Annie...Ù‚As part of my duties on the marketing team, I do my best to introduce as many people as possible to the fine MMORPG that is FFXIV.ÙÃTogether with everyone involved in the making of the FINAL FANTASY XIV channel, it will be our pleasure to continue recruiting the new heroes who are to become your future adventuring companions.¢ko©ìµœì •í•´¢zh¬ç™½æ‰æµ©å—£¦quests§1015703‹¥patch¢id§1015703¢en±Mitsutoshi Gondai¢ja»ã‚´ãƒ³ãƒ€ã‚¤ãƒ»ãƒŸãƒ„ãƒˆã‚·¢de±Mitsutoshi Gondai¢fr±Mitsutoshi Gondai¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙNAssistant director and lead battle planner Mitsutoshi Gondai, at your service.ÙŠIt's been two years since the release of A Realm Reborn, and, thanks to our loyal players, we've been able to put out our first expansion!ÙÀWe won't stop there, of courseâ”€everyone on the dev team will continue working their hardest to create quality content. Hmmm, maybe we'll go with the final boss for the next extreme battle...¢ko¶ê³¤ë‹¤ì´ ë¯¸ì¸ í† ì‹œ¢zh¬æƒä»£å…‰ä¿Š¦quests§1015713‹¥patch¢id§1015713¢en¦Nonora¢ja©ãƒŽãƒŽãƒ©¢de¦Nonora¢fr¦Nonora¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¢ko©ë…¸ë…¸ë¼¢zh©è¯ºè¯ºæ‹‰¦quests‘…¢idÎ␀V¤name„¢en¬A World Away¢ja»æ–°ç”Ÿç¥­ã¨éŽ®é­‚ã®å¤œç©º¢de·So nah und doch so fern¢fr²Si loin, si proche¤icon´/i/080000/080113.png§rewards’‚¢idÍ/!¦amount‚¢idÍ/¦amount¦banner´/i/100000/100462.png§1015714‹¥patch¢id§1015714¢en²wandering minstrel¢ja¯ç•°é‚¦ã®è©©äºº¢de²Fahrend[a] SÃ¤nger¢fr±mÃ©nestrel errant¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¢ko°ë– ëŒì´ ì‹œì¸¢zh¯å¼‚å›½çš„è¯—äºº¦quests‘…¢idÎ␀V¤name„¢en¬A World Away¢ja»æ–°ç”Ÿç¥­ã¨éŽ®é­‚ã®å¤œç©º¢de·So nah und doch so fern¢fr²Si loin, si proche¤icon´/i/080000/080113.png§rewards’‚¢idÍ/!¦amount‚¢idÍ/¦amount¦banner´/i/100000/100462.png§1015715‹¥patch¢id§1015715¢en²wandering composer¢ja²ç•°é‚¦ã®éŸ³æ¥½å®¶¢de²Fahrend[a] Musiker¢fr¯musicien errant¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¢ko³ë– ëŒì´ ìŒì•…ê°€¢zh²å¼‚å›½çš„éŸ³ä¹å®¶¦quests‘…¢idÎ␀V¤name„¢en¬A 