=¡zË@¸Që…¸¢ko¯ì¿ ì•™í‹¸ë¦¬ì˜¤¢zh¯åº“å®‰è’‚åˆ©å¥¥¦quests§1033942Œ¥patchE¢id§1033942¢en¦Maunie¢ja©ãƒ¢ãƒ‹ãƒ¼¢de¦Maunie¢fr¦Maunie¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘Ù²What with the unstable aether, the weather 'round these isles can change in the blink of an eye. I just hope it cools off soonâ”€I can almost feel the skin meltin' from my bones!¨position…¦zoneidÍo£mapÍH¡xË@ Ü(õÂ\¡yË@2Š=p£×
