=p¤¡yË@™™™™™š¡z␀¢ko¯ë¸”ë£¨ì˜´ë·”ë‹¤¢zh¯å¸ƒæ´›å§†å¨è¾¾¦quests§1041224Œ¥patchM¢id§1041224¢en©V'mah Tia¢ja»ãƒ´ã‚¡ãƒ»ãƒžãƒãƒ»ãƒ†ã‚£ã‚¢¢de©V'mah Tia¢fr©V'mah Tia¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù¢Arenvald has pressing matters, according to him anyway. A pity he couldn't be here to witness this momentous occasion, though he bids me tell you congratulations.ÙWAs for me, well, once the Scions disband, I intend to resume my work in Rhalgr's Reach.Ù’I suppose Arenvald will need support in Gyr Abania too, though he would not admit as much. Well, he will have my help, whether he wants it or not.¨position…¦zoneidÍá£mapÌˆ¡xË@…¸Që…¡yË@£×
=p¤¡zË¿„záG®{¢ko°ë°”ë§ˆí•˜ í‹°ì•„¢zh³ç»´Â·çŽ›å“ˆÂ·æäºš¦quests§1041225Œ¥patchM¢id§1041225¢en¨Aergmhus¢ja¯ã‚¨ãƒ«ã‚°ãƒ ã‚¹¢de¨Aermghus¢fr¨Aergmhus¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙÁWell, if it isn't Mistress [UNHANDLED 0x2C]! Long has it been since we last met, but surely you haven't forgotten, have you? 'Tis I, Aergmhusâ”€formerly of the Maelstrom and the Crystal Braves!ÙéUpon returning from my mission abroad, Tataru called me to the Rising Stones and asked me to â€œprepare for the worst.â€ And though the worst has yet to come, I must abstain from indulging in a glass of wine until after it's passed.¨position…¦zoneidÍá£mapÌˆ¡xË@\(õÂ¡yË@ÌÌÌÌÌÍ¡z␀¢ko¯ì—ì–´ê·¸ë¬´ìŠ¤¢zh¯è‰¾å°”æ ¼å§†æ–¯¦quests§1041226Œ¥patchM¢id§1041226¢en©Bluomwyda¢jaµãƒ–ãƒ«ã‚ªãƒ ã‚¦ã‚£ãƒ€¢de©Bluomwyda¢fr©Bluomwyda¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù§It's been quite some time, hasn't it? As I recall, Ishgard was still at war with Nidhogg's brood when last we spoke. I hear the dragoon from those days is a Scion now.ÙÀAs for Aergmhus and I, we recently returned from a mission in the provinces, where we built up an information network at Riol's behest. The man's a tyrantâ”€had us working every waking moment.ÙìAnyroad, the two of us have been tasked with keeping watch over the Rising Stones, but I'm keeping a closer watch on Aergmhus and his alcohol intake. Last thing I need is for the man to be in a drunken stupor when trouble comes our way.¨position…¦zoneidÍá£mapÌˆ¡xË@¸Që…¸¡yË@®záG®¡z␀¢ko¯ë¸”ë£¨ì˜´ë·”ë‹¤¢zh¯å¸ƒæ´›å§†å¨è¾¾¦quests§1041228Œ¥patchM¢id§1041228¢en°large green bird¢ja²ç·‘ã®å¤§ããªé³¥¢de·groÃŸ[a] grÃ¼n[a] Vogel¢fr°gros oiseau vert¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@@¦fffff¡yË@$¸Që…¡zË?ù™™™™™š¢ko´ì»¤ë‹¤ëž€ ë…¹ìƒ‰ ìƒˆ¢zh¯ç»¿è‰²çš„å¤§é¸Ÿ¦quests§1041229Œ¥patchM¢id§1041229¢en®large red bird¢ja²èµ¤ã®å¤§ããªé³¥¢deµgroÃŸ[a] rot[a] Vogel¢fr±gros oiseau rouge¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@@šáG®{¡yË@%¸Që