=¡yË@1¨õÂ\)¡zË¿×®záG®¢ko©ìœ¨ë£¨ìŠ¤¢zh©å°¤å¢æ–¯¦quests§1042202Œ¥patchM¢id§1042202¢en¬Fourchenault¢ja¯ãƒ•ãƒ«ã‚·ãƒ¥ãƒŽ¢de¬Fourchenault¢fr¬Fourchenault¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙäOh, 'tis you. Rest assured all is well here. Slowly but surely, we work to restore normalcy in the wake of the exodus. There is much to be doneâ”€to discuss and decideâ”€but it is a labor to cherish, afforded us by your victory.ÙOnce again, permit me to express my gratitude for your valorous deeds. Not only as a member of the Forum, but simply as a parent.ÙËAs much as they have grown and proven themselves, I ask that you continue watching over my children. See that they do not engage in anything needlessly recklessâ”€I fear my heart cannot take much more...¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@\(õÂ¡yË@;¸Që…¸¡zË¿Ç
