¢ko¬í‘¸ë¥´ìŠˆë…¸¢zh¬å¯Œå°”ä»€è¯º¦quests§1042203Œ¥patchM¢id§1042203¢en¨Thancred¢ja²ã‚µãƒ³ã‚¯ãƒ¬ãƒƒãƒ‰¢de¨Thancred¢fr¨Thancred¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙFAh, fancy meeting you here. Come to look in on the starship, have you?Ù†I must say, it already feels like an age ago that we enhanced the vessel's aetherburner and then rode it forth unto the great unknown.Ù Sometimes, I find myself gazing up at the starry sky, wondering if it was all just a dream. Once behind you, even the grandest adventures become but a memory...¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@.záG®¡yË@;ŒÌÌÌÌÍ¡zËÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀¢ko¬ì‚°í¬ë ˆë“œ¢zh¬æ¡‘å…‹ç‘žå¾·¦quests§1042204Œ¥patchM¢id§1042204¢en¨Urianger¢ja²ã‚¦ãƒªã‚¨ãƒ³ã‚¸ã‚§¢de¨Urianger¢fr¨Urianger¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù`Well, well... I know not what errand bringeth thee hither, but thine is ever a welcome presence.ÙÉThere being no inherent urgency to begin our wanderings, Thancred and I did decide to first see how fareth the discussions between the Forum and the Loporrits and, should it be necessary, lend our aid.ÙïIn exploring the uses of the moon and ventures beyond the star, soon or late, other parties will inevitably seek to be involved. We must needs ensure that the tendrils of dark designs are not permitted to wend their way into this endeavor.¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@.záG®¡yË@;‚\(õÃ¡zËÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀¢ko¬ìœ„ë¦¬ì•™ì œ¢zh¬äºŽé‡Œæ˜‚çƒ­¦quests§1042205Œ¥patchM¢id§1042205¢en©Livingway¢ja¸ãƒªãƒ´ã‚£ãƒ³ã‚°ã‚¦ã‚§ã‚¤¢de©Livingway¢fr©Livingway¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÚIf it isn't [UNHANDLED 0x2C]! How have you been feeling? No dizziness or nausea or some ailment or other after the journey? In particular, if you're having hallucinations, it may mean that an alien life-form has taken over your brain, and invasive surgery will be required to remove it.Ùd...That was a jest. Did you like it? Urianger says it's useful for building rapport with you people.ÙÐAnyway, you may have heard that I'll be staying on Etheirys for a while. We're exploring all sorts of ways to make use of the moon, which means we're going to need to establish regular flights there and back!¨position…¦zoneidÍ|£mapÍ·¡xË@.#×
