¡zËÀ␀␀␀␀␀␀¢ko¬ë¦¬ë¹™ì›¨ì´¢zh©ç”Ÿå‘½å¨¦quests§1042206Œ¥patchM¢id§1042206¢en¨Y'shtola¢ja²ãƒ¤ãƒ»ã‚·ãƒ¥ãƒˆãƒ©¢de¨Y'shtola¢fr¨Y'shtola¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙNWell now, have you come to check on Master Matoya? How very thoughtful of you.ÙÛShe appreciates your visits, even though she would never admit it. Despite her years, she remains as indefatigable as ever. To hear her tell it, she means to cite abandonment and claim the Antitower as private property.Ù†For my part, I'm glad to see you too. I'm only here until I find the tome I'm after in the library, so your timing couldn't be better.¨position…¦zoneidÍô£mapÌý¡xË@®záG®¡yË@¸Që…¸¡zË?ØQë…¸R¢ko¬ì•¼ìŠˆí†¨ë¼¢zh®é›…Â·ä¿®ç‰¹æ‹‰¦quests§1042207Œ¥patchM¢id§1042207¢enªG'raha Tia¢ja¸ã‚°ãƒ»ãƒ©ãƒãƒ»ãƒ†ã‚£ã‚¢¢deªG'raha Tia¢frªG'raha Tia¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙX[UNHANDLED 0x2C], I didn't know you were in Sharlayan! You'll be staying awhile, I hope?ÙÌLest you wonder, we've yet to receive a commission of note, and it hasn't been terribly exciting. The past few days have been mind-numbingly dull, in factâ”€Krile has me sorting endless stacks of tomes...ÙÞI'm still working through them at the moment, but perhaps later we can go and have a meal together? I should like to hear about your recent adventures...and of course I'd be more than amenable to embarking on one together!¨position…¦zoneidÍé£mapÍæ¡xË@ffffff¡yË@\(õÂ¡z␀¢ko°ê·¸ë¼í•˜ í‹°ì•„¢zh³å¤Â·æ‹‰å“ˆÂ·æäºš¦quests§1042208Œ¥patchM¢id§1042208¢en¥Krile¢ja©ã‚¯ãƒ«ãƒ«¢de¥Krile¢fr¥Krile¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks¨position…¦zoneidÍé£mapÍæ¡xË@…¸Që…¡yË@\(õÂ¡z␀¢ko©ì¿ ë£¨ë£¨¢zh©å¯éœ²å„¿¦quests§1042209Œ¥patchM¢id§1042209¢en¨Estinien¢jaµã‚¨ã‚¹ãƒ†ã‚£ãƒ‹ã‚¢ãƒ³¢de¨Estinien¢fr¨Estinien¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙYou're here too? I thought I would've moved on by now, but Vrtra hasn't deigned to reveal the details of his request yet. So here I still am.Ù^But I can't complain. I have my own chambers and am being well looked after. Too well, even...ÙxI can't help but suspect that they're softening me up for an especially bothersome task. Still, the food is excellent...¨position…¦zoneidÍ{£mapÍ¶¡xË@&æfffff¡yË@™™™™™š¡zË?ž¸Që…¸¢ko¯ì—ìŠ¤í‹°ë‹ˆì•™¢zh¯åŸƒæ–¯è’‚å°¼å®‰¦quests§1042211Œ¥patchM¢id§1042211¢en¨Thancred¢ja²ã‚µãƒ³ã‚¯ãƒ¬ãƒƒãƒ‰¢de¨Thancred¢fr¨Thancred¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙJNo need to explainâ”€I have a rough idea what happened while I was...gone.ÙðIt was a strange feeling. As though I was struggling in a pitch-black sea. A powerful tide was trying to wash me awayâ”€one that churned with hatred and envy for lifeâ”€and it was all I could do to swim against it. Then suddenly I was here.Ù¥It felt long and short at the same time. Hazy as in a dream. But through it all, one thing was crystal clear: you fought with all your being to keep our hopes alive.¨position…¦zoneidÍ€£mapÍ»¡xË@5¡G®zá¡yË@5½p£×
=¡zË@záG®{¢ko¬ì‚°í¬ë ˆë“œ¢zh¬æ¡‘å…‹ç‘žå¾·¦quests§1042212Œ¥patchM¢id§1042212¢en¨Y'shtola¢ja²ãƒ¤ãƒ»ã‚·ãƒ¥ãƒˆãƒ©¢de¨Y'shtola¢fr¨Y'shtola¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’ÙQTo go and see all those places and more... Emet-Selch has given you quite a task.ÙfSuffice it to say, I should be glad to assist you. Once we've returned together triumphant, of course.¨position…¦zoneidÍ€£mapÍ»¡xË@5¦fffff¡yË@5™™™™™š¡zË@záG®{¢ko¬ì•¼ìŠˆí†¨ë¼¢zh®é›…Â·ä¿®ç‰¹æ‹‰¦quests§1042213Œ¥patchM¢id§1042213¢en¨Urianger¢ja²ã‚¦ãƒªã‚¨ãƒ³ã‚¸ã‚§¢de¨Urianger¢fr¨Urianger¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘‘Ù†For all the lives on those stars whose light hath been extinguishedâ”€for the ancients who went before usâ”€I offer a solemn prayer...¨position…¦zoneidÍ€£mapÍ»¡xË@5«…¸Qì¡yË@5®záG®¡zË@záG®{¢ko¬ìœ„ë¦¬ì•™ì œ¢zh¬äºŽé‡Œæ˜‚çƒ­¦quests§1042214Œ¥patchM¢id§1042214¢en¨Estinien¢jaµã‚¨ã‚¹ãƒ†ã‚£ãƒ‹ã‚¢ãƒ³¢de¨Estinien¢fr¨Estinien¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙsI can't claim I fully understood the workings of this place. But in that moment, I felt I knew what I needed to do.Ù’I felt that it was the right time to offer up this life I owe. That I could risk it all on the wager that the rest of you would manage without me.Ù'Full glad am I to see that I was right.¨position…¦zoneidÍ€£mapÍ»¡xË@5\(õÂ¡yË@5¸Që…¸¡zË@záG®{¢ko¯ì—ìŠ¤í‹°ë‹ˆì•™¢zh¯åŸƒæ–¯è’‚å°¼å®‰¦quests§1042215Œ¥patchM¢id§1042215¢enªG'raha Tia¢ja¸ã‚°ãƒ»ãƒ©ãƒãƒ»ãƒ†ã‚£ã‚¢¢deªG'raha Tia¢frªG'raha Tia¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙSAs different and mysterious as the ancients may be, they were people not unlike us.ÙYThe first people to fall and feel pain. And the first forced to find a way to rise again.ÙHFrom them we have come, and in our pain and suffering, we are connected.¨position…¦zoneidÍ€£mapÍ»¡xË@5‚\(õÃ¡yË@5«…¸Qì¡zË@záG®{¢ko°ê·¸ë¼í•˜ í‹°ì•„¢zh³å¤Â·æ‹‰å“ˆÂ·æäºš¦quests§1042216Œ¥patchM¢id§1042216¢en©Alphinaud¢ja¯ã‚¢ãƒ«ãƒ•ã‚£ãƒŽ¢de©Alphinaud¢fr©Alphinaud¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘’Ù'Tis my fervent ho