=q¡yË@!záG®{¡zË?®¸Që…¸¨festivalÌˆ¢ko³í†¤ë² ë¦¬ êµ°í•™ìž¢zhµå†¬è´åˆ©å†›äº‹å­¦è€…¦quests§1044991¥patchV¢id§1044991¢en®sweet tonberry¢ja¾ãŠã£ã¨ã‚Šãƒˆãƒ³ãƒ™ãƒªæ•™æŽˆ¢deÙ"vorfreudig[a] Tomberry-Professorin¢frÙ professeure tomberry insouciante¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“ÙTWhy, hello there, [UNHANDLED 0x2C]. It warms this old woman's heart to see you well!ÙùWe're just on our way to examine the stelae and ruins of the Black Shroud. Our mammet friend continues to be quite the voracious reader of ancient languages, you know. Oh, it's been so long since I've done fieldwork, I feel as giddy as a first-year!Ù®But I have to say, this tonberry masquerade is absolutely fascinating. Hah! I can't wait to brag to the Faculty of Anthropologyâ”€I daresay they'll be <i>green</i> with envy!¨position…¦zoneid5£map¡xË@%␀␀␀␀␀␀¡yË@!™™™™š¡zË?±ë…¸Qì¨festivalÌˆ¢koºì˜¨í™”í•œ í†¤ë² ë¦¬ êµìˆ˜¢zh¸æ²‰ç¨³çš„å†¬è´åˆ©æ•™æŽˆ¦quests§1044992¥patchV¢id§1044992¢en®timid tonberry¢ja»æ°—å¼±ãªãƒˆãƒ³ãƒ™ãƒªåŠ©æ‰‹¢de·schÃ¼chtern[a] Tomberry¢frºassistant tomberry timorÃ©¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù?[UNHANDLED 0x2C]!? Oh dear, erâ”€this isn't what it looks like!ÙðWe've come on an official matter, I assure you. There are certain relics in the Black Shroud we aim to investigate, and we only dropped by these festivities to refresh our minds before embarking on some truly rigorous and draining research.ÙÃ...But you aren't troubled by such particulars, are you? <sigh> Deary me, I apologize. I'm so used to defending the validity of our research stipend that I'm afraid I prattled on. Pay me no mind!¨position…¦zoneid5£map¡xË@$ð£×
