e of heart!Ù¿Apparently, there's this one serpentâ”€the Great White Tsuchinokoâ”€that's almost impossible to find. Though Khloe bets with all the adventuring you do, you'll come across it sooner or later!Ù9You've already crossed paths with it!? That's incredible!¨position…¦zoneid£map¡xË@&€␀␀␀␀␀¡yË@,ž¸Që…¡zË?Ü(õÂ\)¨festivalÌ•¢ko³ì¿ ë¡œ ì•Œë¦¬ì•„í¬¢zh´åº“æ´›Â·é˜¿é‡Œäºšç€¦quests§1051361¥patchd¢id§1051361¢en¦Rowena¢ja¬ãƒ­ã‚¦ã‚§ãƒŠ¢de¦Rowena¢fr¦Rowena¥title„¢en ¢ja ¢de ¢fr ¬defaultTalks‘“Ù£Got some time before my next meetin'â”€figured I'd give this Slithery Trivia Trial a shot. Heard there's a lucky li'l somethin' waiting at the end of the quiz too.Ù™Claimin' something bestows good fortuneâ”€well that's hardly somethin' you can prove, right? But folks have been lining up to get their hands on a prize!ÙñWhich got me thinkin'. Clearly there's a demand for lucky bits and bobsâ”€if I get the word out that my goods magically help with money woes, or somethin' to that effect, people'll happily hand over an extra gil or two! I'll be rakin' it in!¨position…¦zoneid£map¡xË@&W
